<h1>Upload a file</h1>
<p>Uploads are private until you explicitly share with selected approved users. Microsoft Office files, including macro-enabled documents, are untrusted. Never enable macros unless you trust their source.</p>
<p>Files are not scanned by Portal before download. Scheduled Synology antivirus scanning may occur later.</p>
<p>Supported extensions: {{extensions}}.</p>
<form id="upload-form" method="POST" action="/uploads/intents">
  <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="{{csrfToken}}" />
  <label>File<input type="file" name="file" required /></label>
  <label>Title<input name="title" maxlength="200" required /></label>
  <label>Description<textarea name="description" maxlength="2000"></textarea></label>
  <button type="submit">Upload privately</button>
</form>
<p id="upload-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
<noscript>Uploading requires JavaScript. Existing downloads remain available.</noscript>
<script src="/js/uploads.js" defer></script>
